          "prompt": "Using the attached Rider Gym 2 rendering as the environmental base, preserve its architecture, wall artwork, windows, exterior view, equipment placement, floor materials, lighting direction, perspective, and visible copyright credit. Add a woman in her late twenties to early thirties wearing black yoga pants and a black sports bra, seated in a butterfly pose facing camera on a charcoal-gray yoga mat. Frame her tightly while keeping the Rider gym recognizable. Engrave the approved Rider wordmark into the mat on the viewer’s right. Produce a 16:9 editorial hero with no campaign headline or subheading baked into the image.",
